      "products": [
        {
          "name": "Sohu",
          "description": "Etched定制的AI加速器芯片，专为运行Transformer模型设计，采用低电压推理技术和混合内存系统，旨在实现比通用GPU更快、更便宜、更节能的推理性能。",
          "target_customers": "运行大规模AI推理工作负载的企业",
          "features": [
            "低电压推理技术",
            "混合内存系统（HBM与SRAM）",
            "专为Transformer模型硬编码"
          ],
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-93ad55204895a7ae",
              "quote": "At the centre of that effort is Sohu, Etched’s custom AI accelerator.",
              "source_content_hash": "ea6962ff49d28cc4",
              "quote_hash": "f9a30aa23e3b97500f4d38054e95f3c4103deaa3d3538472d890b88539b0d1f6"
            },
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-76d3c4de416491cd",
              "quote": "Working with TSMC, Etched has developed a technology it calls low-voltage inference, essentially running the chips at lower voltage to prevent overheating.",
              "source_content_hash": "adda6a37385850c7",
              "quote_hash": "ee781e5ccbb2741cdfce200ba77ab9f694c71e052c23b811a3002c4ebbe9d7cb"
            },
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-76d3c4de416491cd",
              "quote": "The company also developed a memory system that combines two different kinds — the High-Bandwidth Memory that’s critical to Nvidia’s chips and the Static Random-Access Memory that’s increasingly being used in chips meant for fast responses to AI queries.",
              "source_content_hash": "adda6a37385850c7",
              "quote_hash": "d0384d761efbe6b7ba2df361756d6d1c6ce08284658beca3e15b6c01fe2cbda7"
            }
          ],
          "entity_id": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Frontier Inference Clusters",
          "description": "包含Sohu芯片、定制机架和软件的全栈系统，旨在帮助前沿模型以更快、更便宜、更节能的方式运行推理。",
          "target_customers": "需要大规模推理服务的AI公司",
          "features": [
            "定制电路板",
            "芯片冷却板",
            "网络连接"
          ],
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-b750a2ea9e7c7b76",
              "quote": "It calls these systems “frontier inference clusters,” bundles that include the chips along with custom-designed racks and software, all built to help frontier models run inference faster, more cheaply, and with better power efficiency than rivals",
              "source_content_hash": "ae0a2fdbd54bc340",
              "quote_hash": "cd059aff52bcd7961de18c80fe8f82292bdff7b64f4d62665ac61f5c6c246574"
            },
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-76d3c4de416491cd",
              "quote": "Besides creating custom chips, Etched designs its entire server rack — the circuit boards, plates for cooling the chips, networking connections and more.",
              "source_content_hash": "adda6a37385850c7",
              "quote_hash": "2acde1e5a3f7e9b6796be977f715deb18a34731c677610c3770ca631986c41c3"
            }
          ],
          "entity_id": null
        }
      ],
